<title>BELGIUM: EU cuts molasses import tariff.</title>
<headline>EU cuts molasses import tariff.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday cut the import duty on cane molasses to 0.04 Ecu per 100 kg from 0.05 Ecu, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The tariff was based on a representative price of 8.17 Ecus per 100 kg,&quot; the official added.</p>
<p>The import duty on beet molasses remains suspended at zero based on a representative price of 11.23 ecus per 100 kg.</p>
</text>
